      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I almost dismissed this post, until I read the comments about users on Quest having no form of access to an avatar reset function. On PC this problem is entirely trivial since you just reset using the keyboard, but if Quest hasn't any method of their own, then that's actually a legitimate enough problem to need some kind of fix.\nIn the mean time, to any Quest users suffering this issue, the best solution I can think of is to find/borrow a PC that you can temporarily install VR-Chat on, and then use the \"CTRL + \\\" hotkey to reset your avatar to a default one. You could then uninstall the game from that PC and resume playing on your Quest.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
