      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Why? Would the developer of this game VR Chat allow an avatar that is 1.Too Big for any board. 2.Will have millions of quest maybe more players stuck in an avatar (The Giant Red Robot) they can not change out of no matter what they do. To the creator/developer of this game. It wouldn't be hard for you to delete this avatar. If us players need a view from above the entire board then Tinker Bell, a Luck Dragon, Anything would be better then The Giant Red Robot with it's head stuck in the trees that is impossible for Quest users to change out of and also impossible to enter any chatroom with. VR Chat is completely ruined for me and I barely got to play it. Nice Graphics. I shouldn't be able to even say I like Rec Room better then your game. But it is better because I can actually play in Rec Room. I can not even move in VR Chat because of that Giant Red Robot. Please delete it. It is more of a virus that ruins your entire game for every quest user that tries to clone it or use it then a useful practical avatar. It is even to big to socialize with the smaller avatars I know this because the other players using that Giant Red Robot had to bend all the way down just to hear me or talk to me. I am sure this avatar is gonna get a ton of complaints from every quest user that tries it and gets stuck in it. It's a major glitch please delete that avatar.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
